Important cmds
mportant Git commands
Command	Purpose
git switch main	Switch to main branch
git switch -c feature	Create and switch to a new branch
git branch	List branches
git push origin main	Push changes to main
git pull origin main	Get latest main branch changes

Remember:
- git switch main → Switch branch.
- git add → Stage changes.
- git commit → Save changes locally.
- git push origin main → Upload changes to GitHub's main branch.